  <div class="t"><p class="b">A dark room. Her mother switches on an old projector, and a square<br/>of light appears on the wall. It felt like light itself could tell stories.</p><p class="b" style="margin-top:34px">She grew up in Lviv, in a family of artists. Painting, photography,</p></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
  <div class="t c319" style="margin-left:702px"><p class="b">A dark room. Her mother switches on an old projector, and a square<br/>of light appears on the wall. It felt like light itself could tell stories.</p><p class="b" style="margin-top:34px">She grew up in Lviv, in a family of artists. Painting, photography,</p></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
